<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Fixed effect estimates for LLMs predicting probability and acceptability judgments. Effects are shown as contrasts relative to the reference levels: relation = irrelevant, metric = acceptability.</figcaption>
