<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 16: </span>Type III ANOVA table for fixed effects in the mixed-effects model of <em id="A1.T16.7" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">Qwen 72B (few-shot)</em> judgments. Probability and acceptability ratings are predicted by conditional probability, relation type, and judgment type. Degrees of freedom are computed using the Kenward–Roger approximation. Significance codes: <span id="A1.T16.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">***</span> <math id="A1.T16.m34" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.001" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.001</annotation></semantics></math>, <span id="A1.T16.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">**</span> <math id="A1.T16.m35" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;.01" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;.01</annotation></semantics></math>, <span id="A1.T16.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">*</span> <math id="A1.T16.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
