<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 20: </span>Pairwise comparisons of estimated marginal means at low, medium, and high conditional probability for all LLMs and humans. SE: <math id="A1.T20.m219" class="ltx_Math" alttext="0.01-0.04" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.01</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0.04</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">0.01-0.04</annotation></semantics></math> for all. Statistical significance at <math id="A1.T20.m220" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p&lt;0.05" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p&lt;0.05</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
</figure>
